# Build-context exclusions for packaging/Dockerfile (BuildKit picks up <Dockerfile>.dockerignore).
# Keep the context small: only the Rust workspace and apps/web are needed.
.git/
.github/
target/
**/*.rs.bk
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
apps/android/
apps/flasher/
firmware/
tools/
protocol/
scripts/
CHANGELOG.md
CONTRIBUTING.md
SECURITY.md
CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md
packaging/
apps/web/src-tauri/
